you> assistant> I can help you brainstorm, draft, plan, and revise ideas using this conversation. When you ask about your healthcare course, I can search the local vault and cite the original passages. Use `wiki ask` for standalone evidence-only answers and `wiki search` to inspect source text directly. A useful start is: ‘Help me compare fee-for-service and value-based payment.’
[retrieval=no; Conversational/meta turn does not need notes.]
